                    <!-- 11. Your Treatment Journey — Consultation to Recovery -->
                    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-9 mb-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">Your Outstation Treatment Journey — Step-by-Step</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">
                        We understand that traveling to another city for surgery can cause anxiety. Our clinical team coordinates every detail before you leave your home district:
                    </p>
                    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base mb-6">
                        <li><strong>Step 1: Diagnostic Review &amp; Teleconsultation:</strong> Send your recent ultrasound, CT scan reports, and medical history via WhatsApp or our secure portal. Dr. Kumaragurubaran reviews your imaging, determines surgical eligibility, confirms whether laparoscopic or robotic repair is indicated, and answers preliminary questions.</li>
